  "how": "use_figma, the per-page JS in scripts/figma_inventory.py's docstring. One call per page: the Plugin API allows one page switch per call.",
  "scope": "Frame and component NAMES, plus variant values for the application component page. Nine pages of the 2026-09-06 structure (vinc.plan.figma-product-structure §2): 01 · Foundations, 02 · App Components, 04 · Surfaces, 05 · Overlays, 06 · States, 08 · Reference, 10 · Site Components, 11 · Site Screens, 12 · Docs Screens. 00 · Cover, 03 · App Shell, 07 · Prototypes, 13 · Email and 90 · Archive carry nothing the gate counts.",
  "note": "Machine dump. Never patch it by hand: re-run the dump. A hand-patched inventory makes the gate agree with a file instead of with Figma.",
  "site_screens_note": "11 · Site Screens boards are html-to-design captures named Site · <Route>[ · <state>] / dark; children are not recorded because the site axis compares board names with the capture manifest.",
  "app_boards_note": "04/05/06 boards are html-to-design captures of the running app named App · <Surface>[ · <state>] / <theme>; children are not recorded."
